title: "Privacy-Preserving Shopping Intelligence via Federated and On-Device Learning"
abstract: >-
  Pre-registered, full-catalogue comparison of cloud, federated and on-device sequential
  recommendation on the REES46 e-commerce log, with privacy audits and browser deployment
  measurements. MSc graduation project of PPSI Group 8 (Digilians 2026), Queen's University,
  School of Computing.
